---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import icon from "../assets/icon.webp";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { RELEASES_URL, NIGHTLY_RELEASES_URL } from "../lib/releases";
import {
  INSTALL_GUIDE_URL,
  MOBILE_SOURCE_GUIDE_URL,
  REMOTE_ACCESS_GUIDE_URL,
  SOURCE_INSTALL_GUIDE_URL,
  WEB_APP_URL,
} from "../lib/site";
---

<Layout title="Get Rove Code — Choose your way in." description="Get the Rove Code desktop app, pair the web app with your own host, or build the mobile client. Free and open source.">
  <div class="download-page container">
    <header class="download-heading">
      <h1>Choose your<br />way in.</h1>
      <p class="section-copy">A desktop app, a browser tab, or a client on your phone. Your workspace stays on the machine you connect to.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="client-options">
      <section class="desktop-option" aria-labelledby="desktop-title">
        <div class="desktop-heading">
          <Image src={icon} width={64} height={64} alt="" loading="eager" />
          <div><h2 id="desktop-title">Start on desktop.</h2><p>Your workspace, ready to run locally.</p></div>
        </div>
        <p>The desktop app bundles a Rove host. Connect your providers and start working, or add a remote machine from Connections.</p>
        <ul class="platforms" aria-label="Desktop platforms"><li>macOS</li><li>Windows</li><li>Linux</li></ul>
        <div class="actions"><a class="button" href={RELEASES_URL}>Browse desktop releases</a><a class="text-link" href={NIGHTLY_RELEASES_URL}>Nightly builds</a></div>
        <p class="release-note">Choose your OS and architecture on GitHub. macOS builds are self-signed, not notarized; Windows builds may show SmartScreen warnings. <a href={INSTALL_GUIDE_URL}>Read installation notes</a> before installing.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="web-option" aria-labelledby="web-title">
        <svg class="browser-icon" width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5" y="8" width="38" height="32" rx="5"/><path d="M5 18h38M11 13h2M17 13h2M23 13h2"/></svg>
        <h2 id="web-title">Or open a tab.</h2>
        <p>Use the hosted web app with your own Rove host. It’s a client, not a cloud machine running your agents.</p>
        <a class="button button-secondary" href={WEB_APP_URL}>Open the web app</a>
        <p class="web-note">Already have a host? Pair it in Settings → Connections. The hosted app needs a reachable HTTPS endpoint, such as Tailscale HTTPS.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href={REMOTE_ACCESS_GUIDE_URL}>How to connect a host</a>
      </section>
    </div>

    <section class="mobile-option" aria-labelledby="mobile-title">
      <div><h2 id="mobile-title">For the smaller screen.</h2><p>The iOS and Android apps are source-only. Build a dev client, then pair it with a host you run. No App Store or Google Play releases yet.</p></div>
      <a class="text-link" href={MOBILE_SOURCE_GUIDE_URL}>Build the mobile client</a>
    </section>

    <section class="host-option" aria-labelledby="host-title">
      <div class="host-copy"><h2 id="host-title">Bring a machine<br />of your own.</h2><p>Install a CLI host to keep your workspace available without the desktop app. Run it on Linux or Apple Silicon macOS, then pair a client.</p><a class="text-link" href={INSTALL_GUIDE_URL}>Read the host install guide</a></div>
      <div class="host-commands">
        <p>With Node.js and npm available for installation:</p>
        <pre tabindex="0" aria-label="CLI host installation commands"><code>npm install -g @rove-code/cli
rove service install
rove service status</code></pre>
        <p>Linux needs systemd (including WSL). macOS uses launchd. <a href={REMOTE_ACCESS_GUIDE_URL}>Set up remote access</a> to connect from another device.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="source-option" aria-labelledby="source-title">
      <h2 id="source-title">Prefer to build it yourself?</h2>
      <p>Install Node.js 24 and <a href="https://viteplus.dev/guide/">Vite+</a>, then clone the repository. Install and authenticate a coding-agent provider on the same machine.</p>
      <details>
        <summary>Show source setup commands</summary>
        <pre tabindex="0" aria-label="Source build commands"><code>git clone https://github.com/hafiezul/rove.git
cd rove
vp i
vp run dev</code></pre>
        <p>The server prints a local web address. For the development desktop app, run <code>vp run dev:desktop</code> from the same checkout.</p>
      </details>
      <a class="text-link" href={SOURCE_INSTALL_GUIDE_URL}>Read the development guide</a>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .download-page { padding-bottom: 5rem; }
  .download-heading { padding-block: 4rem; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; align-items: end; gap: 4rem; }
  .download-heading h1 { font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 6.5vw, 6rem); }
  .download-heading p { max-width: 43ch; padding-bottom: .5rem; }
  .client-options { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr; gap: 2rem; }
  .desktop-option { padding: 2.5rem; border-radius: 24px; background: var(--bg-elev); }
  .desktop-heading { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .desktop-heading img { border-radius: 16px; }
  .desktop-heading h2, .web-option h2 { font-size: 2rem; }
  .desktop-heading p { font-size: .9rem; margin-top: .35rem; }
  .desktop-option p, .web-option p { color: var(--fg-muted); max-width: 52ch; }
  .platforms { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1.5rem; margin-block: 1.5rem; padding: 0; list-style: none; font-size: .85rem; font-weight: 500; }
  .desktop-option .actions { gap: 1rem; }
  .desktop-option .text-link { font-size: .85rem; }
  .desktop-option .release-note { margin-top: 1.5rem; font-size: .8rem; }
  .release-note a { text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  .web-option { padding: 1.5rem 1rem 1.5rem 2rem; }
  .browser-icon { color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .web-option > p { margin-block: 1rem 1.5rem; }
  .web-option .web-note { font-size: .85rem; margin-bottom: .7rem; }
  .web-option .text-link { font-size: .85rem; }
  .mobile-option { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 3rem; padding-block: 2.5rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .mobile-option h2 { font-size: 1.6rem; }
  .mobile-option p { margin-top: .7rem; color: var(--fg-muted); max-width: 68ch; font-size: .9rem; }
  .mobile-option > a { flex-shrink: 0; font-size: .85rem; }
  .host-option { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 4rem; padding-block: 4rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .host-copy h2 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.8vw, 3rem); }
  .host-copy p { color: var(--fg-muted); margin-block: 1.25rem; max-width: 44ch; }
  .host-copy a { font-size: .9rem; }
  .host-commands p { color: var(--fg-muted); font-size: .85rem; margin-block: .5rem 1rem; }
  .host-commands p:last-child { margin-block: 1rem 0; }
  .host-commands a { text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  .source-option { padding-top: 3rem; max-width: 760px; }
  .source-option h2 { font-size: 1.75rem; }
  .source-option > p { color: var(--fg-muted); margin-block: 1rem; }
  .source-option > a { font-size: .9rem; }
  details { margin-block: 1.5rem; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; padding: 1rem 1.25rem; }
  summary { cursor: pointer; font-size: .9rem; font-weight: 500; }
  details pre { margin-top: 1rem; }
  details p { font-size: .85rem; color: var(--fg-muted); margin-top: 1rem; }
  details code { font-size: .85rem; }
  @media (max-width: 1000px) {
    .client-options { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem; }
    .desktop-option { padding: 2rem; }
    .desktop-heading { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
    .web-option { padding-left: 1.5rem; }
    .host-option { gap: 2rem; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .download-heading { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.5rem; padding-block: 2.5rem; }
    .download-heading h1 { font-size: clamp(3rem, 13vw, 4rem); }
    .client-options, .host-option { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2rem; }
    .desktop-option { padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 18px; }
    .desktop-heading { flex-direction: row; gap: .85rem; }
    .desktop-heading img { width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 12px; }
    .desktop-heading h2 { font-size: 1.65rem; }
    .desktop-heading p { font-size: .8rem; }
    .web-option { padding: 1rem 0; }
    .mobile-option { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 1rem; padding-block: 2rem; }
    .host-option { padding-block: 3rem; }
    pre { padding: 1rem; font-size: .75rem; }
    details { padding: .9rem; }
    details code { font-size: .7rem; }
  }
</style>
